-       Which engine a literal pattern compiles for is decided while the code compiles, by the
-       `Regex.Backend` given in scope, and `import soundness.*` brings neither in: the default,
-       with no import, is `java.util.regex`, and the linear-time engine is chosen by name.
+       El motor para el que se compila un patrón literal se decide mientras se compila el código,
+       mediante el given `Regex.Backend` del ámbito, e `import soundness.*` no trae ninguno: el
+       motor por defecto, sin importación, es `java.util.regex`, y el motor de tiempo lineal se
+       elige por nombre.

=       with no import, is `java.util.regex`, and the linear-time engine is chosen by name.
